<%- /*
Scaffolded as .golangci.yml by go-service and go-library (internal/flavor/definitions.go).

golangci-lint v2 schema: the leading version key is mandatory from v2 on, and a file
without it is rejected with "unsupported version of the configuration" before any linter
runs. The enabled set is the correctness subset of praetor's own gate, not a mirror of it:
the repository's .golangci.yml also enables gocyclo, gocognit and funlen (the linters that
carry the HISS-04 caps) plus nolintlint, forbidigo, contextcheck, wastedassign,
copyloopvar and gochecknoinits. An adopter therefore receives HISS-07 and HISS-10
enforcement here and not the HISS-04 caps: only the function-LOC cap reaches them, through
praetor's own scanner (internal/hiss/rules.go).
*/ -%>
version: "2"
run:
  timeout: 10m
linters:
  default: none
  enable:
    - govet
    - staticcheck
    - errcheck
    - errorlint
    - nilerr
    - unused
    - ineffassign
    - bodyclose
    - noctx
  settings:
    errcheck:
      check-type-assertions: true
      check-blank: true
